      "id": 478923,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-08-26T04:56:03.014Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/gdelacruz-nts\">@gdelacruz-nts</a></p>\n<p>Both item line level and the whole document level discounts available in ERPNext and it can be applied either with a percentage of discount or discount amount either ways.</p>\n<p>Item level discount is located in item table where either discount amount or percentage can be inserted based on price list rate as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/5/b578aa1891d436dd926e8c223e44034723dcdbd7.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b578aa1891d436dd926e8c223e44034723dcdbd7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/5/b578aa1891d436dd926e8c223e44034723dcdbd7_2_690x424.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"pTmWyIDzTdlZjWNJ65VWpBPcs3Z\" width=\"690\" height=\"424\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/5/b578aa1891d436dd926e8c223e44034723dcdbd7_2_690x424.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/5/b578aa1891d436dd926e8c223e44034723dcdbd7_2_1035x636.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/5/b578aa1891d436dd926e8c223e44034723dcdbd7_2_1380x848.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFAF6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1391×855 60.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>On the other hand, if discount is common for the whole <strong>Quotation</strong> then Additional Discount section is available under tax table where one can apply discount either on Net total (item table total before tax) or grand total (item table total + tax ). In your case, additional discount on net total where amount based discount is applied resulting a new net total as 2100 ;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/8/38ded462684aa98c99acc09f007dc83ac6cc1b74.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/38ded462684aa98c99acc09f007dc83ac6cc1b74\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/8/38ded462684aa98c99acc09f007dc83ac6cc1b74_2_690x474.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"8769dhTTenJauJVnyNbutAfffx2\" width=\"690\" height=\"474\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/8/38ded462684aa98c99acc09f007dc83ac6cc1b74_2_690x474.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/8/38ded462684aa98c99acc09f007dc83ac6cc1b74_2_1035x711.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/8/38ded462684aa98c99acc09f007dc83ac6cc1b74.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFAF7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1277×879 51.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
