      "id": 487921,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:00:55.627Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/gdelacruz-nts\">@gdelacruz-nts</a></p>\n<p>You have to play with Rate field to come to your desired Amount for the item line as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/2/f2fc07f8f0efc8bb6a1295b586abad4fda3bfc27.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f2fc07f8f0efc8bb6a1295b586abad4fda3bfc27\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/2/f2fc07f8f0efc8bb6a1295b586abad4fda3bfc27_2_690x323.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"yFxwmSrKLbhgZpO5LL48ts5sUWb\" width=\"690\" height=\"323\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/2/f2fc07f8f0efc8bb6a1295b586abad4fda3bfc27_2_690x323.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/2/f2fc07f8f0efc8bb6a1295b586abad4fda3bfc27_2_1035x484.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/2/f2fc07f8f0efc8bb6a1295b586abad4fda3bfc27_2_1380x646.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBF9F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1902×892 66.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Otherwise custom script can handle such request.</p>",
